File name: GNOL2LOP.MP
Path description: Gnoll Encampment, easy loop.
Path starts: Hillside Path, Guard Post.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 1
Level recommendation: 18-25
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: gnoll axeman, gnoll scout.
Additional information:

Included in the zip are BOATGNOL.MP, GNCHGNOL.MP, GNOLBOAT.MP and
GNOLGNCH.MP which are paths to and from the start of this loop, depending
which way you come in from. If you come via the silvery river (fastest
way if you are coming from Silvermere), you will need a wooden skiff. If
you come via the Dragon's Teeth Hills, you won't need anything, unless you
come from inside the slums, in which case you need a rusty iron key.

This loop is designed for lower level people, as it excludes the chieftain.
The paths to and from the start of this loop are also useful for the
default Gnolls loop.
